sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Agent
    participant B as build.py (Python)
    participant R as router.mjs (Node)
    participant N as audit.py (Python)
    participant X as cross_audit.py
    A->>A: Read SKILL.md format and source material
    A->>A: Write model.json using the skill's format
    A->>B: Build diagram from model.json
    loop Try bounded drawing candidates
        B->>B: Measure text and place rectangles
        B->>R: Rectangles, obstacles, connection sites
        R-->>B: Edge IDs and point lists
        B->>B: Place labels and emit SVG
        B->>N: SVG + expected model
        N-->>B: Findings and drawing measures
        B->>B: Rank candidate and choose next trial
    end
    B-->>A: SVG, PNG, model, recipe and report
    A->>X: Check selected SVG independently
    X-->>A: Second geometry report
    A->>A: Inspect preview at document width
